# Dockerfile-specific ignore file (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile).
# The Data-Juicer image is built from the REPOSITORY ROOT because it copies the runner package
# from backend/src, so everything is excluded except what datajuicer/Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!datajuicer/requirements.txt
!backend/src/__init__.py
!backend/src/operators/__init__.py
!backend/src/operators/datajuicer/
**/__pycache__
